                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              │ When I’m not at work, I enjoy cooking, reading, and spending time with my husband sitting on the porch drinking coffee and watching our neighbors (deer, raccoons, and opossums) come and go. Since moving to the country, I have been trying to learn as much as I can about the plants that grow on our property and how to be a good steward of the land. I’m especially looking forward to the leaves changing, as this will be our first fall in our home! The area in and around Monroe County is so beautiful and reminds me of where I grew up in Maryland. │
